## Rule Shape

```yaml
rules:
  - name: {{ example_rule_name }}
    enabled: true
    event: {{ example_event }}
    action: {{ example_action }}
    conditions:
      - field: {{ example_field }}
        operator: {{ example_operator }}
        pattern: "{{ example_pattern }}"
    message: "{{ example_message }}"
```

## Failure Modes

- Matching fields that do not exist in the target event.
- Using broad regexes that block safe work.
- Blocking without a recovery message.
